1 NOTE <p class="MsoPlainText">Henry's death cert shows his parents as Patrick Cannon and Ann McIntire. I had looked at Henry before as in the 1901 census he lived in a house owned by Patrick Cannon. Both Ma
2 CONC ry Martins mentioned Henry. Mary in Ballinalost said that her Aunt Mary Ann went to America for a short while and that a Mary Cannon came to visit her and that Mary Cannon she was some close relation 
2 CONC of Henry Cannon. Mary Martin in America also mentioned that she lived Henry Cannons family but didn't say what relation she was to them.</p>
