1 TITL U.S. Yearbooks Name Index, 1890-1979
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT The same person will often occur in previous or subsequent editions of the same yearbook and these related yearbooks are presented at the bottom of the individual’s record – to assist the research
2 CONC er in finding other books where their person of interest might be found.This collection is a name index produced by MyHeritage from the U.S. Yearbooks, 1890-1979 collection and is based on the same se
2 CONC t of yearbooks. Thanks to this name index users will enjoy improved name searching and more relevant Record Matches to their family members found in these books. In case you didn’t find what you wer
2 CONC e looking for, we encourage you to check out the U.S Yearbooks 1890-1979 collection to search the entire free-text index of this amazing collection.
