1 TITL Kentucky Births, 1911 - 1999
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT Birth records represent one of the key primary sources for family information, typically being issued within days of a birth and containing the parents' names at a minimum. Many times they contain add
2 CONC itional parental details including places of birth, ages, number of children and religious affiliation for baptism and christening records.
