1 TITL New Zealand, Death Index, 1840-2021
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT Deaths have been officially recorded in New Zealand since 1848, and were originally under the jurisdiction of the Colonial Secretary. A law in 1913 required that Mäori deaths also be registered, and 
2 CONC these records were part of a separate registration system until 1961. The records in this collection are provided by the New Zealand Department of Internal Affairs.
